wuzong"},{"id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m033-0266","start":266,"end":267,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"qsj_qnd_c34","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p033","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong"},{"id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m033-0282","start":282,"end":283,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"qsj_qnd_c34","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p033","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong"},{"id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m033-0310","start":310,"end":312,"surface":"王勃","kind":"person","person_id":"qsj_qnd_c34","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p033","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong"},{"id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m033-0326","start":326,"end":327,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"qsj_qnd_c34","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p033","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong"},{"id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m033-0345","start":345,"end":347,"surface":"王勃","kind":"person","person_id":"qsj_qnd_c34","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p033","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong"},{"id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m034-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"qsj_qnd_c34","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p034","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-shiji059-044","subject_person_id":"qsj_qnd_c34","predicate":"mother","object_person_id":"xix_lzk_s92","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p033","quote":"初，憲王舜有所不愛姬生長男棁。棁以母無寵故，亦不得幸於王。王後修生太子勃。王內多，所幸姬生子平、子商，王后希得幸。及憲王病甚，諸幸姬常侍病，故王后亦以妒媢不常侍病，輒歸舍。醫進藥，太子勃不自嘗藥，又不宿留侍病。及王薨，王后、太子乃至。憲王雅不以長子棁為人數，及薨，又不分與財物。郎或說太子、王后，令諸子與長子棁共分財物，太子、王后不聽。太子代立，又不收恤棁。棁怨王后、太子。漢使者視憲王喪，棁自言憲王病時，王后、太子不侍，及薨，六日出舍，太子勃私姦，飲酒，博戲，擊筑，與女子載馳，環城過市，入牢視囚。天子遣大行騫驗王后及問王勃，請逮勃所與姦諸證左，王又匿之。吏求捕勃大急，使人致擊笞掠，擅出漢所疑囚者。有司請誅憲王後修及王勃。上以修素無行，使棁陷之罪，勃無良師傅，不忍誅。有司請廢王後修，徙王勃以家屬處房陵，上許之。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"王後修生太子勃","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"依明示子、生、母與局部世系主語保存，不因繼位或太子稱本身補父子，不補未名成員及同父同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji059-056","person_id":"qsj_qnd_c34","title":"太子","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p032","quote":"常山憲王舜，以孝景中五年用皇子為常山王。舜最親，景帝少子，驕怠多淫，數犯禁，上常寬釋之。立三十二年卒，太子勃代立為王。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji059-056:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p032","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"太子","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m032-0051","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"explicit_end","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p032","quote":"常山憲王舜，以孝景中五年用皇子為常山王。舜最親，景帝少子，驕怠多淫，數犯禁，上常寬釋之。立三十二年卒，太子勃代立為王。"}]}},"interpretation_note":"來源授封、徙封、承爵、職位與用稱分存；相對年數保持原語，不換算公曆或由死亡、首次提及補起訖。王號中的諡字不當生前正式授爵名。 終點依明示廢、徙、國除／國絕或太子代立，不延伸至其他官爵。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji059-057","person_id":"qsj_qnd_c34","title":"王","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p032","quote":"常山憲王舜，以孝景中五年用皇子為常山王。舜最親，景帝少子，驕怠多淫，數犯禁，上常寬釋之。立三十二年卒，太子勃代立為王。"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p034","quote":"勃王數月，遷于房陵，國絕。月餘，天子為最親，乃詔有司曰：「常山憲王蚤夭，后妾不和，適孽誣爭，陷于不義以滅國，朕甚閔焉。其封憲王子平三萬戶，為真定王；封子商三萬戶，為泗水王。」"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji059-057:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p032","start":57,"end":58,"surface":"王","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m032-0051","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type"